  "private": true,
  "expo": {
    "install": {
      "comment": "Force a single react-native-worklets 0.7.4 (see root overrides) — reanimated 4.2.1's podspec requires the 0.7.x line (rejects 0.8.x), and a stray nested 0.8.3 otherwise splits the Babel plugin from the runtime. Excluded from `expo install --fix`.",
